From fe46b5df6b4b7ff1bd6a6ff37e8d5620d023c315 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 17:04:17 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(sidebar): preserve member actions and dismissal identity
 [daveey]

Keep the presentation-only grouping boundary while restoring member-specific
machine labels, base project menus/context menus, and path-less worktree guards.
Dismiss members individually and restrict group hide to auto-discovered members.

Proof: copied the three independent reviewer probes into named suites and added
explicit action-item parity across overview/entered dropdown/context surfaces.
Source-only reviewed production restore fails 10 of 11 cases; repaired controls
pass. Current-window classification is shared by both machine-heading consumers.
Placement, hydration, Home and store merge remain unchanged.
